# 传感器驱动开发文档

## 概述

OpenVela RTOS 提供了统一的传感器驱动框架，基于 uORB 消息总线实现传感器数据的发布/订阅。

**来源：** 基于 OpenVela 仓库中 `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` 和 `nuttx/include/nuttx/sensors/sensor.h` 的源代码分析。

---

## 传感器类型

### 健康传感器

| 类型 | 定义 | 数据结构 | 单位 |
|------|------|----------|------|
| **心率** | `SENSOR_TYPE_HEART_RATE` (21) | `struct sensor_hrate` | BPM |
| **心跳** | `SENSOR_TYPE_HEART_BEAT` | `struct sensor_hbeat` | 次/分钟 |
| **ECG** | `SENSOR_TYPE_ECG` | `struct sensor_ecg` | mV |

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` - `SENSOR_TYPE_HEART_RATE`

### 运动传感器

| 类型 | 定义 | 数据结构 | 单位 |
|------|------|----------|------|
| **加速度计** | `SENSOR_TYPE_ACCELEROMETER` (1) | `struct sensor_accel` | m/s² |
| **陀螺仪** | `SENSOR_TYPE_GYROSCOPE` (4) | `struct sensor_gyro` | rad/s |
| **磁力计** | `SENSOR_TYPE_MAGNETIC_FIELD` (2) | `struct sensor_mag` | μT |
| **方向** | `SENSOR_TYPE_ORIENTATION` (3) | `struct sensor_ori` | 度 |
| **线性加速度** | `SENSOR_TYPE_LINEAR_ACCELERATION` (10) | `struct sensor_accel` | m/s² |
| **旋转矢量** | `SENSOR_TYPE_ROTATION_VECTOR` (11) | `struct sensor_quat` | 四元数 |
| **步数检测** | `SENSOR_TYPE_STEP_DETECTOR` (18) | `struct sensor_step` | 步 |
| **步数计数** | `SENSOR_TYPE_STEP_COUNTER` (19) | `struct sensor_step` | 步 |

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` - `SENSOR_TYPE_ACCELEROMETER`

### 环境传感器

| 类型 | 定义 | 数据结构 | 单位 |
|------|------|----------|------|
| **气压计** | `SENSOR_TYPE_BAROMETER` (6) | `struct sensor_baro` | hPa |
| **温度** | `SENSOR_TYPE_TEMPERAUTRE` (7) | `struct sensor_temp` | °C |
| **湿度** | `SENSOR_TYPE_RELATIVE_HUMIDITY` (12) | `struct sensor_humi` | % |
| **光照** | `SENSOR_TYPE_LIGHT` (5) | `struct sensor_light` | lux |
| **接近** | `SENSOR_TYPE_PROXIMITY` (8) | `struct sensor_prox` | cm |

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` - `SENSOR_TYPE_BAROMETER`

---

## 传感器数据结构

### 心率传感器

```c
struct sensor_hrate {
    uint64_t timestamp;       /* 时间戳，单位：微秒 */
    float bpm;                /* 心率值，单位：BPM */
    int32_t status;           /* 校准状态 */
};
```

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` - `struct sensor_hrate`

### 加速度计

```c
struct sensor_accel {
    uint64_t timestamp;       /* 时间戳，单位：微秒 */
    float x;                  /* X 轴，单位：m/s² */
    float y;                  /* Y 轴，单位：m/s² */
    float z;                  /* Z 轴，单位：m/s² */
    float temperature;        /* 温度，单位：°C */
    int32_t status;           /* 校准状态 */
};
```

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` - `struct sensor_accel`

### 陀螺仪

```c
struct sensor_gyro {
    uint64_t timestamp;       /* 时间戳，单位：微秒 */
    float x;                  /* X 轴，单位：rad/s */
    float y;                  /* Y 轴，单位：rad/s */
    float z;                  /* Z 轴，单位：rad/s */
    float temperature;        /* 温度，单位：°C */
    int32_t status;           /* 校准状态 */
};
```

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` - `struct sensor_gyro`

### 心跳传感器

```c
struct sensor_hbeat {
    uint64_t timestamp;       /* 时间戳，单位：微秒 */
    float beat;               /* 心跳值，单位：次/分钟 */
    int32_t status;           /* 校准状态 */
};
```

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h` - `struct sensor_hbeat`

---

## 传感器设备路径

传感器设备通过 uORB 框架注册，设备路径格式：

```
/dev/uorb/sensor_<type>
```

**示例：**
- 心率：`/dev/uorb/sensor_hrate`
- 加速度计：`/dev/uorb/sensor_accel`
- 陀螺仪：`/dev/uorb/sensor_gyro`
- 气压计：`/dev/uorb/sensor_baro`

**来源：** `apps/system/sensortest/sensortest.c` - `DEVNAME_FMT "/dev/uorb/sensor_%s"`

---

## 传感器 API

### 1. 打开传感器设备

```c
int fd = open("/dev/uorb/sensor_hrate", O_RDONLY | O_NONBLOCK);
if (fd < 0) {
    perror("Failed to open sensor");
    return -1;
}
```

### 2. 读取传感器数据

```c
struct sensor_hrate data;
ssize_t ret = read(fd, &data, sizeof(data));
if (ret == sizeof(data)) {
    printf("Heart Rate: %.1f BPM\n", data.bpm);
    printf("Timestamp: %" PRIu64 "\n", data.timestamp);
}
```

### 3. 使用 poll 等待数据

```c
struct pollfd fds[1];
fds[0].fd = fd;
fds[0].events = POLLIN;

int ret = poll(fds, 1, 1000);  // 超时 1 秒
if (ret > 0 && (fds[0].revents & POLLIN)) {
    struct sensor_hrate data;
    read(fd, &data, sizeof(data));
    printf("Heart Rate: %.1f BPM\n", data.bpm);
}
```

### 4. 关闭传感器设备

```c
close(fd);
```

**来源：** `apps/system/sensortest/sensortest.c`

---

## 传感器驱动开发

### 1. 定义传感器数据结构

```c
// 在 nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h 中添加
struct sensor_spo2 {
    uint64_t timestamp;       /* 时间戳，单位：微秒 */
    float spo2;               /* 血氧饱和度，单位：% */
    int32_t status;           /* 校准状态 */
};
```

### 2. 注册传感器类型

```c
// 在 nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h 中添加
#define SENSOR_TYPE_SPO2  XX
```

### 3. 实现传感器驱动

```c
#include <nuttx/sensors/sensor.h>

static int spo2_activate(FAR struct sensor_lowerhalf_s *lower,
                         FAR struct file *filep, bool enabled)
{
    // 启用/禁用传感器
    return OK;
}

static int spo2_set_interval(FAR struct sensor_lowerhalf_s *lower,
                             FAR struct file *filep,
                             FAR unsigned int *period_us)
{
    // 设置采样间隔
    return OK;
}

static int spo2_fetch(FAR struct sensor_lowerhalf_s *lower,
                      FAR struct file *filep,
                      FAR char *buffer, size_t buflen)
{
    // 读取传感器数据
    struct sensor_spo2 *spo2 = (struct sensor_spo2 *)buffer;
    spo2->timestamp = sensor_get_timestamp();
    spo2->spo2 = read_spo2_sensor();
    spo2->status = 0;
    return sizeof(struct sensor_spo2);
}

static const struct sensor_ops_s g_spo2_ops = {
    .activate      = spo2_activate,
    .set_interval  = spo2_set_interval,
    .fetch         = spo2_fetch,
};
```

### 4. 注册传感器驱动

```c
int spo2_register(FAR const char *devpath)
{
    FAR struct sensor_lowerhalf_s *lower;
    int ret;

    lower = kmm_zalloc(sizeof(struct sensor_lowerhalf_s));
    if (lower == NULL) {
        return -ENOMEM;
    }

    lower->ops = &g_spo2_ops;
    lower->type = SENSOR_TYPE_SPO2;

    ret = sensor_register(lower, devpath);
    if (ret < 0) {
        kmm_free(lower);
        return ret;
    }

    return OK;
}
```

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/sensors/sensor.h`

---

## 传感器数据发布

### 使用 uORB 发布传感器数据

```c
#include <uORB/uORB.h>

// 定义主题
ORB_DECLARE(sensor_hrate);

// 发布数据
int publish_heart_rate(float bpm) {
    struct sensor_hrate data;
    data.timestamp = ktime_get_ns() / 1000;  // 转换为微秒
    data.bpm = bpm;
    data.status = 0;

    orb_advert_t pub = orb_advertise(ORB_ID(sensor_hrate), &data);
    if (pub == NULL) {
        return -1;
    }

    return orb_publish(ORB_ID(sensor_hrate), pub, &data);
}
```

### 订阅传感器数据

```c
#include <uORB/uORB.h>

// 订阅主题
int sub = orb_subscribe(ORB_ID(sensor_hrate));
if (sub < 0) {
    return -1;
}

// 检查更新
bool updated;
orb_check(sub, &updated);
if (updated) {
    struct sensor_hrate data;
    orb_copy(ORB_ID(sensor_hrate), sub, &data);
    printf("Heart Rate: %.1f BPM\n", data.bpm);
}

// 取消订阅
orb_unsubscribe(sub);
```

**来源：** `apps/system/uorb/sensor/hrate.h`

---

## 传感器测试工具

### sensortest 命令

```bash
# 测试心率传感器
sensortest -n 10 sensor_hrate

# 测试加速度计
sensortest -n 10 sensor_accel

# 测试陀螺仪
sensortest -n 10 sensor_gyro
```

**来源：** `apps/system/sensortest/sensortest.c`

### sensorscope 命令

```bash
# 查看所有传感器
sensorscope

# 查看特定传感器
sensorscope sensor_hrate
```

**来源：** `apps/system/sensorscope/sensorscope_main.c`

---

## 黄山派传感器配置

### defconfig 配置

```
# 传感器配置
CONFIG_SENSORS=y
CONFIG_SENSOR=y
CONFIG_UORB=y

# 心率传感器
CONFIG_SENSORS_HRATE=y

# 加速度计
CONFIG_SENSORS_ACCEL=y

# 陀螺仪
CONFIG_SENSORS_GYRO=y
```

**来源：** `vendor/sifli/boards/sf32lb52/lckfb_huangshan_pi/configs/nsh/defconfig`

---

## 低功耗传感器管理

### 1. 动态采样率

```c
// 根据活动状态调整采样率
if (is_active) {
    set_sensor_interval(fd, 100000);   // 100ms
} else {
    set_sensor_interval(fd, 1000000);  // 1s
}
```

### 2. 批量读取

```c
// 使用批量读取减少唤醒次数
struct sensor_hrate data[10];
ssize_t ret = read(fd, data, sizeof(data));
```

### 3. 传感器休眠

```c
// 禁用传感器
ioctl(fd, SNIOC_ACTIVATE, false);

// 启用传感器
ioctl(fd, SNIOC_ACTIVATE, true);
```

**来源：** `nuttx/include/nuttx/sensors/sensor.h`

---

## 参考资料

1. **源代码位置：**
   - uORB 头文件：`nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h`
   - 传感器头文件：`nuttx/include/nuttx/sensors/sensor.h`
   - 传感器测试：`apps/system/sensortest/sensortest.c`
   - 传感器范围：`apps/system/sensorscope/sensorscope_main.c`
   - uORB 传感器：`apps/system/uorb/sensor/`

2. **配置文件：**
   - `nuttx/include/nuttx/uorb.h`
   - `vendor/sifli/boards/sf32lb52/lckfb_huangshan_pi/configs/nsh/defconfig`

3. **文档更新时间：** 2026-08-07

